    /// `[T::ALL[0], T::ALL[0], T::ALL[1]]`, `T::ALL[0]` sits at count
    /// `2 >= 2`, `T::ALL[1]` at count `1` (the SOLE singleton-
    /// multiplicity witness), `T::ALL[2..]` at count `0`;
