        // drift_between_*` pins at clauses (7) + (82) + (84) — this
        // pin closes the structural-drift-catches sweep on the
        // (`usize`-decl, allocating, with-hint) corner of the
        // 4-axis surface, matching the shape (82) pins at the
        // non-allocating corner one side-effect axis over.
