        // strict-equality test against `0` would silently return `true`
        // for every target past the (max == 0, every-count == 0)
        // degenerate arm — the empty-slice guard maps `&[]` to `false`
        // before the test. Sibling posture to the empty-slice guard on
        // `count_modal_variants` one ARITY axis over: the set-level
        // cardinality-count collapses to `0`; this per-target predicate
        // collapses to `false` at every target on the same endpoint.
