        // is `true` for every variant `v` — the sole position hits the
        // target, `T::max_variant_count([v])` collapses to `1`, and the
        // target satisfies `count == max == 1`. Sibling posture to
        // `count_modal_variants([v]) == 1` one ARITY axis over: the set-
        // level cardinality-count reports `1` (only the target
