        // `T::is_unique_modal_variant_of(v, items) == (T::modal_variants(items) == vec![v])`
        // — when `items` has a unique mode, T::modal_variants collapses
        // to a length-`1` Vec containing EXACTLY that unique variant.
        // When `items` has no unique mode, T::modal_variants returns
