        // T::sorted_extremal_variants(items).first().copied()` — the
        // singular OPTION-return LEX-order direction-composition union
        // first-witness AGREES with the FIRST element of the plural
        // VEC-return LEX-order direction-composition union witness-
        // collection walked in the same lex-order canonical order.
        // Sibling posture to
