        // T::unique_extremal_variant(items).is_some() ==
        // T::has_unique_extremal_variant(items). Independent cross-check
        // distinct from the guarded-lift arm on the surface axis
        // (Option::is_some vs conditional-Option construction). At
        // CARDINALITY 3 both sides collapse to `false` on every
        // canonical fixture — the identity holds STRUCTURALLY at every
