        // reports `1`, T::has_unique_unique_variant returns `true`,
        // and the guarded find lands on `v` at its declaration-order
        // slot in T::ALL. Sibling posture to
        // unique_repeating_variant_returns_none_on_every_matching_singleton
        // one MULTIPLICITY-BAND axis over (which lands on `None`
